"switch to the CCVaultio app and activate Dapp account" You need to go into settings for your wallet and enable DApp account

@everyone 

10 Minutes!!! 

You do not need to refresh when the timer ends. The page will take 2-4 seconds to refresh and then you will see a "enter queue" button.

@everyone 

On your marks, get set...GO! GO! GO! The GTI Javelin mint is NOW LIVE! 

WE WILL NOT DM YOU!!!

@everyone 

Good news! - you have more time to prepare.

The ChainPort team is working hard to be the first Cardano bridge, and they need a little more time before we launch. This might give current peak congestion issues a chance to settle as well. The good news is you have more time to prepare your wallets if you plan to purchase COPI on Minswap. In the meantime, the team will continue to market and spread the word about COPI becoming a native asset on the Cardano blockchain.
